---
description: Keep every source line at or under 100 characters
alwaysApply: true
---

# Line length

ESLint `max-len` is 100. A longer line fails the pre-commit hook and the commit is rejected.

- Count the whole line, including indentation.
- Break template strings, JSX, HTML, function calls, and conditions before column 100.
- Do not disable `max-len` to keep a line intact.

```typescript
// Bad: one attribute list longer than 100 characters
<button type="button" class="{{styles.menuItem}} {{styles.menuItemDanger}}" id="delete-chat-button">

// Good: each line stays within the limit
<button
  type="button"
  class="{{styles.menuItem}} {{styles.menuItemDanger}}"
  id="delete-chat-button"
>
```
